                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "A small ramen shop with high quality food! We ordered salty ramen with good pork and chicken plus super delicious soup. Side dishes were so tasty as the starters. 😋\n\nThe shop is clean and tidy with simple decor.\nWe will definitely want to come again.\n\nStaff is helpful to introduce the ramen to new comers.\n\nWe came at 7:30pm and only waited for about 30 minutes.  We are managed to sit near the shop and also found an almond drink next store to drink while waiting for the seats.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
